WEBVTT
NOTE Think Outside the Chat · W3_AIIntentGap · EN · narrator kokoro:am_michael

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.012
Sometimes, AI doesn't deliver the result you expected.

2
00:00:06.212 --> 00:00:12.156
You may spend extra time correcting answers, rewriting instructions, or starting over.

3
00:00:13.356 --> 00:00:15.814
That lost time is your AI Intent Gap.

4
00:00:17.014 --> 00:00:23.069
In this step, we'll estimate it using a few simple questions about your daily AI use,

5
00:00:23.069 --> 00:00:27.200
unsuccessful results, and the time spent correcting them.

6
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.597
Use your best estimates. They don't need to be perfect.

7
00:00:32.797 --> 00:00:36.954
This gives us a starting point. After your ten training hours,

8
00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:43.055
we'll measure your AI Intent Gap again to compare the results and establish your progress.
